Disney Money.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.990
Frozen for example, just became the highest
grossing animated film of all time last year.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:43.010
So high fives to Studio Mir for being so amazing
at their jobs and high fives to Dreamworks

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.370
for recognizing talent when they see it.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:49.090
The big question is, are Mike and Bryan attached
