00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:04.510
They have been friends with the Studio Mir
people since it was formed.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:08.810
Avatar the original series was basically how
their relationship started.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:13.640
The animation director on the original avatar
series started Studio Mir when Mike and Bryan

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.660
hired him to animate Legend of Korra.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:22.900
In order to meet demand on Korra Studio Mir
grew to the place where it is today.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.120
So without Avatar and Bryke, there would be
no Studio Mir.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.900
That doesn’t guarantee Mike and Bryan will
be involved in any of the Dreamworks shows,

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:34.570
